      "sourceTextSha256": "cc24c3b36a66f2593235c026105f64d1cf37fe6cc262d669b1b9d79c74853e8f",
      "text": "Quepos - Boca Naranjo: 45 minutes.\n\nYou will have a flight from Boca Naranjo airfield to south Silo, Paquita, flying along the Rio Cotos River. We will arrive at the mouth of the Palo Seco River, return along the coast to Quepos, observing the beautiful scenery of the entire coastline, the island of Isla Damas. From the sky, we will see a beautiful view of the Marina Pez Vela Bay, the beach of Playa Espadilla, and fly over  the Manuel Antonio Park and return to Boca Naranjo.",
